[node name="ReadableComponent" parent="DEMO_HINTS/Hint_08_Sittable_Static" index="6" unique_id=1768800036]
readable_title = "Sittables"
readable_content = "This chair contains a [b]Cogito Sittable[/b]

This is a non-physics Sittable.  

It tweens the player to a 'Sit Marker' and makes them look at the 'Look Marker' when interacted with.

The player stays seated until they interact again."
rich_text = true

[node name="CollisionShape3D2" type="CollisionShape3D" parent="DEMO_HINTS/Hint_08_Sittable_Static" unique_id=949904269]
shape = SubResource("SphereShape3D_n25yf")

[node name="Hint_09_Sittable_Auto" parent="DEMO_HINTS" unique_id=1734723871 instance=ExtResource("62_y3og2")]
transform = Transform3D(0, 1, 0, -1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -2.26547, 1.00668, 11.2442)

[node name="ReadableComponent" parent="DEMO_HINTS/Hint_09_Sittable_Auto" index="6" unique_id=1768800036]
readable_title = "Sittables - Sit Area"
readable_content = "[b]Sittables aren't just for seats![/b]

In this instance, a Sittable is used for a trap.  
It uses the [b]Auto[/b] sit area behaviour, causing the player to sit automatically upon entering the area.

No \"Look Marker\" is used here, so the player retains full control of their view.

[b]Other Sit Area behaviours:[/b]  

[b] Manual[/b] : The player can only interact when inside the defined Sit Area. This avoids the player interacting with the seats from behind or any undesired location.

[b]  None[/b]  : The player can interact with the Sittable from anywhere.
"
rich_text = true

